┌ termchat ──────────────────────────────────────────────────── team.example ● connected ┐
│ Keys  ↑↓ scroll  ? close                                                               │
│                                                                                        │
│ Anywhere                                                                               │
│ ?             help; ? or esc closes it, ↑ ↓ pgup pgdn scroll it (outside a text field) │
│ ctrl+k        jump to a conversation or a person                                       │
│ ctrl+n        new conversation: direct message, room, or join an open room             │
│ ctrl+o        room panel: members, invite, remove, rename, leave                       │
│ ctrl+c        quit; asked twice when drafts are unsent                                 │
│ mouse         click a chat, a message, the input or an overlay row; a second click on  │
│               a row acts, and on a message copies it; click outside an overlay to      │
│               close it; the wheel scrolls                                              │
│                                                                                        │
│ Chat list                                                                              │
│ ↑ ↓ k j       move                                                                     │
│ enter         open the chat                                                            │
│ tab           to the thread (standard and wide layouts)                                │
│ /             search history                                                           │
│ pgup pgdn     scroll the thread; home end: oldest, newest                              │
│ r             start a stopped background process                                       │
│ q             quit                                                                     │
│                                                                                        │
│ Thread                                                                                 │
└─ ↑↓ scroll  ? close  q quit ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
